Comment: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:44.09,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,My joys and my sadness
Comment: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:48.88,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,are written in my footsteps, I know...
Comment: 0,0:01:00.56,0:01:04.63,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,What barred the path before me
Comment: 0,0:01:05.76,0:01:10.06,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,was a bright and shining "change".
Comment: 0,0:01:11.24,0:01:13.79,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,There's a paradise I envision,
Comment: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:16.81,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,and when I think that everyone is flying past it,
Comment: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:21.55,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,it makes my heart ache.
Comment: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:24.42,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,I know that I can't
Comment: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:26.99,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,strengthen my soul,
Comment: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:30.34,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,but I can cast off my weakness
Comment: 0,0:01:30.42,0:01:34.21,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,and change, I know? {don't know if we want to edit the punctuation? this was a questionmark in the official lyrics but it's weird}
Comment: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:40.08,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,Your joys and your sadness
Comment: 0,0:01:40.21,0:01:44.87,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,and the growth of this world fill me with love.
Comment: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:50.82,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,I thought I'd reach in as far as I could,
Comment: 0,0:01:50.89,0:01:55.89,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,so I could become stronger and move on.
Comment: 0,0:01:56.14,0:01:58.16,OPE,,0,0,0,karaoke,Count on me Count on me Count on me
