Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.76,0:22:01.72,Signs,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord9\alpha&HFE&\shad0.25\4a&H00&\an5\fnGloria Ramsey\fs100\fscx124\fscy144\c&H3A4896&\4c&HF6F6F6&\fsp5\pos(1482.67,788)}D{\fsp0}ays later
Dialogue: 30,0:00:00.47,0:00:02.11,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:03.11,0:00:07.49,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,{\t(4022,0,1,\c&H000000&)}Sera! Be my bride!
Dialogue: 30,0:00:10.24,0:00:14.54,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,A dream? About that barbarian? But why?
Dialogue: 30,0:00:18.49,0:00:20.63,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is that... sound?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:07.98,0:02:11.86,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What're you doing here?!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:12.52,0:02:17.74,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,What do you mean?\NWhy wouldn't I sleep in my own room?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:21.25,0:02:26.03,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Why am {\i1}I{\i0} in {\i1}your{\i0} room?! \NAnd why're you naked?!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:26.03,0:02:28.25,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You're making quite a fuss\Nfor how early it is.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.39,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Still, it's good to see you \Nso lively after last night.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:35.51,0:02:38.14,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What happened last night...?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:38.72,0:02:41.89,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-I don't remember anything, \Nand I'm not sure I want to!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:42.67,0:02:47.19,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you wouldn't force yourself on me?
Dialogue: 30,0:02:47.19,0:02:49.91,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Come on now, no need to quibble over details.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:49.91,0:02:53.53,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't treat a lady's chastity \Nlike something trivial, you animal!
Dialogue: 30,0:02:53.53,0:02:55.73,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait... Hold on.
Dialogue: 30,0:02:56.36,0:02:59.83,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's bad enough to be captured by barbarians...
Dialogue: 30,0:02:59.83,0:03:01.81,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if I were to bear his child,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:01.81,0:03:04.16,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd be bringing another enemy into my homeland!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{Ki— (add this? - kattara)}
Dialogue: 30,0:03:06.66,0:03:08.42,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Kill me! Now!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.30,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Where's the logic in that?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:12.15,0:03:15.93,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,If you wanted to kill me, I'd understand,\Nbut why want to die?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:17.67,0:03:19.68,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:19.68,0:03:22.19,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,The shame of being defeated \Nand taken captive...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:22.19,0:03:26.16,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,And then attacking a nude, \Nunarmed man in a rage...
Dialogue: 30,0:03:26.16,0:03:28.38,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,It all stains a knight's honor!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:29.09,0:03:32.94,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,So before I bring any further shame,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.95,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'd rather you end my life!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:35.95,0:03:39.82,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Well, that sounds rather unpleasant.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:39.82,0:03:42.46,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,U-Unpleasant?!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:42.46,0:03:44.59,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,How else would you describe the idea
Dialogue: 30,0:03:44.59,0:03:47.58,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,that shame alone is enough \Nto make someone wish for death?
Dialogue: 30,0:03:47.58,0:03:51.77,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You make light of shame and disgrace?!
Dialogue: 30,0:03:51.77,0:03:53.99,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,That may mean nothing to you barbarians,
Dialogue: 30,0:03:53.99,0:03:55.55,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,but for a noble lady—
Dialogue: 30,0:03:54.98,0:03:56.34,Dialogue Overlap,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:56.34,0:03:58.98,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Your clothes are dry.
Dialogue: 30,0:03:59.59,0:04:02.35,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You woke without any trouble.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:02.35,0:04:03.27,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're lucky.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:03.27,0:04:04.17,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:04.79,0:04:07.77,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,After Master Veor returned yesterday...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:11.15,0:04:15.28,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,you had a mild overdose\Nof the sleeping drug used to bring you here,
Dialogue: 30,0:04:15.28,0:04:18.24,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,so you suddenly started vomiting\Nand then collapsed.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:19.23,0:04:22.16,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You had me quite worried.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:22.16,0:04:24.79,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I collapsed? Then...
Dialogue: 30,0:04:25.34,0:04:29.04,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,So that's what you meant by... last night.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.73,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I should apologize.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:30.73,0:04:33.67,Dialogue,Venor,0,0,0,,We gave you the same dosage \Nmy people normally use.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:33.67,0:04:35.41,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It's a type of paralytic poison,
Dialogue: 30,0:04:35.41,0:04:37.42,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,so we brought you to my room \Nso you could rest.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.14,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Paralytic poison?!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:39.14,0:04:42.94,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It slows blood flow,\Nwhich also helps wounds close.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:43.68,0:04:46.35,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Then... you didn't do anything to me?
Dialogue: 30,0:04:46.35,0:04:49.46,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Aside from a misused dose of medicine, no.
Dialogue: 30,0:04:49.46,0:04:52.49,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I can't have you dying\Nright after deciding to marry you!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:53.44,0:04:54.94,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:55.55,0:04:57.68,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Give me a sword!\NI need to knock some sense into you!
Dialogue: 30,0:04:59.10,0:05:01.66,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Looks like I don't need \Nto worry about you.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:02.06,0:05:04.95,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,And breakfast won't go to waste either.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:05.60,0:05:06.98,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Breakfast...?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:06.98,0:05:07.70,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:07.70,0:05:10.74,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You haven't eaten a crumb \Nsince leaving the battlefield.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:10.74,0:05:11.96,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:12.37,0:05:15.52,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting in the next room, \Nso come once you've calmed down.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:15.52,0:05:17.46,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 30,0:05:23.55,0:05:26.44,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can't believe a knight like me
Dialogue: 30,0:05:26.44,0:05:28.73,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,is getting sheltered by barbarians...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:30.36,0:05:31.83,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Grandfather...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:31.83,0:05:35.49,Dialogue,Gadius,0,0,0,,I taught you my swordsmanship \Nwhen you asked to learn,
Dialogue: 30,0:05:35.49,0:05:37.48,Dialogue,Gadius,0,0,0,,and you turned out to be \Nfar too talented...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:37.85,0:05:39.48,Dialogue,Gadius,0,0,0,,If only you were a man...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:40.43,0:05:42.89,Dialogue,Gadius,0,0,0,,or could give up on being a knight...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:42.89,0:05:45.76,Dialogue,Gadius,0,0,0,,{\t(2372,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}you might have known some happiness.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:46.29,0:05:50.20,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Serafina. You've turned down \Nanother marriage proposal.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:50.20,0:05:52.03,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,Your desire to be a knight, as a woman...
Dialogue: 30,0:05:52.03,0:05:54.38,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,How long do you plan \N to keep the selfish indulgence up?
Dialogue: 30,0:05:54.38,0:05:57.98,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,You've more than proven yourself \Nas a leader of knights.
Dialogue: 30,0:05:57.98,0:06:00.39,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,You need to marry\Nwhile there are still suitable matches.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:00.95,0:06:03.41,Dialogue,Sidius,0,0,0,,{\t(1996,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}A sword has never changed policy.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:04.02,0:06:05.32,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Brother...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:05.32,0:06:08.93,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I felt a deep sincerity in your blade.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:09.39,0:06:11.43,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I fell for you then and there.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:12.88,0:06:17.06,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I-I've paid so little mind to my femininity, \Nthe last thing I need is for someone to desire me for it!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.57,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,No... That's not the only problem.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:20.10,0:06:23.08,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,He's a barbarian, \Nand I'm a prisoner of war...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:23.08,0:06:25.20,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,That's all there is to it!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:25.97,0:06:31.78,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}And a prisoner's breakfast\Nis probably nothing but scraps.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:31.78,0:06:34.46,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}They say the quickest way to break someone \Nis through their food.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:35.49,0:06:39.80,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I've endured military rations. \NIt can't be worse than that.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:39.80,0:06:42.97,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will uphold the pride of the Lavillant clan,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:42.97,0:06:45.67,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}chosen for the Eastern Expedition!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:45.67,0:06:47.47,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,There you are, Sera.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.74,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Come, sit.
Dialogue: 30,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.23,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,There's meat!
Dialogue: 30,0:06:53.23,0:06:56.85,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where did this rich meat come from?
Dialogue: 30,0:06:56.85,0:06:58.79,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even back home, something like this...
Dialogue: 30,0:06:58.79,0:06:59.23,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}No,
Dialogue: 30,0:06:59.23,0:07:03.92,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}given the state of my homeland, \NI've never seen such a feast!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:03.92,0:07:07.37,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what a proper portion is\Nfor a female warrior from the west,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:07.37,0:07:09.99,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,but I imagine a quarter should suffice.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:11.70,0:07:15.05,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a quarter?! \NIt's bigger than my torso!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:15.05,0:07:19.04,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What're they up to?\NWhy would they treat me like this?!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:19.04,0:07:21.13,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Not hungry?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:21.13,0:07:24.32,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I see. Your scheme is clear now.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:25.51,0:07:28.71,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Lavishing me with luxury\Nto wear down my knightly pride,
Dialogue: 30,0:07:28.71,0:07:31.76,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,so you can tame me. Is that it?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:31.76,0:07:32.89,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:32.89,0:07:37.88,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,No matter! I'd sooner starve \Nthan be indulged by barbarians!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:40.48,0:07:44.15,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did my stomach really\Nhave to growl right now?!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.12,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,K-Kill me!
Dialogue: 30,0:07:46.12,0:07:48.41,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Do you enjoy saying that?
Dialogue: 30,0:07:48.41,0:07:52.18,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,If your stomach still longs for food, \Nit means your body wants to live.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:52.18,0:07:57.15,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Refusing to eat despite that \Nis nothing but self-deception.
Dialogue: 30,0:07:57.15,0:08:00.93,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Not to mention disrespecting the life taken\Nto bring you this meal.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:00.93,0:08:04.80,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Taking a life is a serious matter,\Nnot something done for sport.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:05.13,0:08:08.02,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Surely the west doesn't see it so differently.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:09.30,0:08:13.50,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,In any case, stop overthinking and eat.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:13.50,0:08:14.56,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:15.66,0:08:17.43,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}That smile...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.24,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,What is it, slave girl?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:22.24,0:08:23.69,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I should tell you...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:24.79,0:08:27.96,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Though Master Veor didn't mention it, \Nsince he took it for granted,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:27.96,0:08:32.26,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,he hunted this meat \Nspecifically to welcome you.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:32.26,0:08:33.70,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,A welcome?
Dialogue: 30,0:08:34.86,0:08:37.16,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,He went out hunting alone,
Dialogue: 30,0:08:37.16,0:08:41.21,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,so you'd have something \Nworthy to eat when you woke.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:41.21,0:08:44.27,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor is as capable \Nas he is renowned...
Dialogue: 30,0:08:44.27,0:08:46.93,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,He would be the equivalent\Nof one of your western royals.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:46.93,0:08:51.09,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,If he's the son of a great chief,\Nthat would make him a prince.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:51.09,0:08:55.85,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Someone like that went to great lengths \Nto show you hospitality.
Dialogue: 30,0:08:56.29,0:08:59.30,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Wouldn't turning it down \Nbe poor manners for a noble?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:02.90,0:09:04.08,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:04.08,0:09:07.94,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,It would shame me as a knight \Nto reject such effort.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:09.99,0:09:13.74,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,But if this is some cheap— \NWait, it's tender?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:21.88,0:09:24.47,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}So good!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:24.47,0:09:27.49,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's so tender, and so juicy!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:27.49,0:09:29.20,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's a slight gaminess,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:29.20,0:09:32.91,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the flavor's so rich \Nit comes across as an accent!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:32.91,0:09:36.67,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I doubt even Illdoren royalty \Nget to eat something like this!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:36.67,0:09:40.27,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Magnificent... Absolutely magnificent!
Dialogue: 30,0:09:40.27,0:09:42.13,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Well? It's good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 30,0:09:43.66,0:09:48.28,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Well, I can hardly complain \Nafter you serve me something like this.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:48.28,0:09:51.26,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,And while I have no intention of marrying you,
Dialogue: 30,0:09:51.26,0:09:53.91,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,this is enough to make me \Noverlook you drugging me.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:55.14,0:09:56.78,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,That's good, then.
Dialogue: 30,0:09:57.26,0:10:00.79,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Though I have to ask, what kind of meat is this?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:00.79,0:10:02.04,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Care to see?
Dialogue: 30,0:10:02.78,0:10:05.86,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It was bled and gutted up in the mountains,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.55,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,but the rest is getting cleaned outside.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:08.55,0:10:11.67,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,If you're curious,\Nyou can look from that window.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:12.81,0:10:14.67,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-I want to know!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:14.67,0:10:18.68,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we could domesticate this creature \Nback home, then maybe...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:19.14,0:10:22.48,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,There's no shortage of them around here.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:25.53,0:10:27.77,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It's called a dragon.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:27.77,0:10:31.44,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,A-A dragon?!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:31.44,0:10:34.74,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Th-This is dragon meat?!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:34.74,0:10:35.45,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:36.67,0:10:38.95,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\t(2135,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}As in... the legendary...
Dialogue: 30,0:10:39.40,0:10:41.54,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,flying monster?!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:41.54,0:10:43.60,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,{\t(1770,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}That's how they're seen in the west.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:43.71,0:10:48.41,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,They're supposed to breathe fire\Nand have toxic flesh!
Dialogue: 30,0:10:48.41,0:10:51.06,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Those exist, but this is a different species.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:52.91,0:10:54.72,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,That aside, Sera,
Dialogue: 30,0:10:54.72,0:10:59.67,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I notice you're... not slowing down.
Dialogue: 30,0:10:59.67,0:11:03.60,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Well, if it tastes good, it tastes good.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:08.79,0:11:11.83,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,I don't think she plans on dying anytime soon.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:14.84,0:11:17.62,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm allowed outside?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:17.62,0:11:21.49,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Yes. There's something around\Nthe mountain I'd like to show you.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:22.99,0:11:26.80,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,What? You look like a dragon \Nthat swallowed a wasp's nest.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:26.80,0:11:31.05,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Obviously, I can't just trust you\Non something like that.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:31.73,0:11:32.88,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,So it's about trust?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:32.88,0:11:36.50,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Of course! I've only been \Nyour prisoner for two days!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:36.50,0:11:39.44,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Not that the time matters, but...
Dialogue: 30,0:11:39.44,0:11:41.97,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Besides, it doesn't make sense,
Dialogue: 30,0:11:41.97,0:11:44.39,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,wandering around lands\Nfilled with such bizarre creatures!
Dialogue: 30,0:11:44.39,0:11:49.60,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You talk about sense, but common sense\Nchanges from place to place.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:49.60,0:11:53.03,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Different creatures and cultures \Nare part of that.
Dialogue: 30,0:11:53.03,0:11:56.03,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Or are you just afraid?
Dialogue: 30,0:11:58.79,0:12:04.15,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can't deny you've baited me into this...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:04.15,0:12:06.04,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,But don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:06.51,0:12:09.99,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,This doesn't mean I trust you.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:09.99,0:12:11.51,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:11.51,0:12:15.67,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Still, I have a feeling\Nyou'll come to like it here.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:16.39,0:12:17.85,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,And what makes you think that?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:17.85,0:12:19.32,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,No reason.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.40,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Just a gut feeling.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:48.83,0:12:51.04,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 30,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.09,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 30,0:12:52.09,0:12:56.84,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,It's just, it's far more abundant \Nand vibrant than I imagined.
Dialogue: 30,0:12:57.27,0:13:00.71,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,The battlefields we fought on were barren,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:00.71,0:13:03.60,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,but life in these lands \Nhas always been strong.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:03.97,0:13:06.30,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Just try not to faint from it all.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:06.30,0:13:08.23,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,D-Don't mock me!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:09.98,0:13:11.83,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn barbarian.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:11.83,0:13:14.44,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}The dragon and this scenery \Nwere basically sneak attacks.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:14.44,0:13:16.62,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know what he plans to show me,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:16.62,0:13:19.82,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}but if I brace myself, \NI won't be caught off guard.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:32.26,0:13:33.90,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,So many animals...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:36.00,0:13:39.86,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Dragons are just another kind of creature\N that lives around here.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.62,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,They're a pain to hunt,
Dialogue: 30,0:13:41.62,0:13:45.67,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,but if you leave their lairs alone, \Nthey won't bother people.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:45.67,0:13:48.39,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You make it sound\Nso easy to get used to!
Dialogue: 30,0:13:48.39,0:13:50.69,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It will be, once you live here.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:50.69,0:13:54.42,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You certainly seemed to enjoy \Nthe one you ate this morning.
Dialogue: 30,0:13:55.52,0:13:57.97,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,M-My food wasn't flying...
Dialogue: 30,0:13:59.27,0:14:01.14,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Then it's no different from poultry.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:05.31,0:14:06.92,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is that sound?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:14.07,0:14:15.67,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:15.67,0:14:18.05,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,a waterfall?! \NI've never seen one before!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:18.05,0:14:19.95,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,What do you think, Sera?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:19.95,0:14:22.01,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Not something you'd see in the west.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:22.01,0:14:26.05,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Are you mocking me? \NMy homeland has its own—
Dialogue: 30,0:14:28.72,0:14:31.11,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}No... It doesn't.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:34.25,0:14:37.32,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to boast.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:37.32,0:14:41.82,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,But I did want you to see it.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:43.05,0:14:46.57,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Now then, there's one more \Nreason I brought you here.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:46.57,0:14:48.26,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,There is?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:48.26,0:14:49.20,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.58,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,First...
Dialogue: 30,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.08,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Strip.
Dialogue: 30,0:14:53.16,0:14:54.88,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-Why would I?!
Dialogue: 30,0:14:54.88,0:14:55.96,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You ask why?
Dialogue: 30,0:14:55.96,0:14:59.46,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,There's only one thing a man and woman \Nwould do in the water without clothes.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:00.87,0:15:02.97,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:02.97,0:15:04.35,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Bathe.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:04.35,0:15:06.82,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Do you have to phrase\Neverything so misleadingly?!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:06.82,0:15:08.72,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Even if I'm getting used to it!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:09.11,0:15:13.25,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Besides, why is there mixed bathing?! \NIt's indecent!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:13.25,0:15:17.43,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You can call it indecent,\Nbut that's just how things are done here.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:17.43,0:15:19.98,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Don't they say, "When in Reom, \Ndo as the Reomans do"?
Dialogue: 30,0:15:21.38,0:15:24.58,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm not taking part in your barbaric customs!
Dialogue: 30,0:15:24.58,0:15:25.99,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,My, you're a fierce one.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:27.51,0:15:29.16,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're starting to smell a bit.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:29.74,0:15:33.12,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,We don't have bathhouses here.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:33.12,0:15:35.80,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Wiping you down like last night \Ncan only do so much.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:35.80,0:15:38.00,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Before long, you'll start to stink...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:40.78,0:15:43.01,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I can't believe you, either.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:43.71,0:15:46.53,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Taking your clothes off\Nwithout hesitation in front of a man...
Dialogue: 30,0:15:46.53,0:15:49.64,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You'll get used to it eventually.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:49.99,0:15:54.12,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor even moved to a different stream\Nbecause you made such a fuss.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.71,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,So I'm here to accompany you.
Dialogue: 30,0:15:57.42,0:16:00.52,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,More like watch me so I can't run.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:00.52,0:16:05.28,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,No, it's more about keeping you safe.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:05.28,0:16:06.43,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,My safety?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:09.76,0:16:12.79,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,There are other creatures out here, \Nlike the sawaiwao.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:13.54,0:16:14.47,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 30,0:16:14.47,0:16:16.29,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't "see?" me!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:17.13,0:16:20.76,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Well, they're all pretty docile \Nif they live around here.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:21.63,0:16:25.83,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You make it sound like\Nwe're surrounded by monsters.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:25.83,0:16:27.28,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Because we are.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:37.69,0:16:40.44,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to bathe \Nwith monsters all around?!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:40.44,0:16:42.35,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm going back!
Dialogue: 30,0:16:42.35,0:16:43.94,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 30,0:16:45.67,0:16:47.45,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 30,0:16:51.54,0:16:54.61,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I ran off without thinking...
Dialogue: 30,0:16:54.61,0:16:58.75,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,but it was careless to leave\Nmy clothes and shoes behind.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:01.71,0:17:04.73,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I'm not happy about it,\Nbut I guess I'll go back and get dressed.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:04.73,0:17:05.75,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:07.43,0:17:10.09,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh no! Someone else is out here!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:12.38,0:17:13.53,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Kill me!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:14.20,0:17:16.67,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What if I run into a true savage,
Dialogue: 30,0:17:16.67,0:17:19.98,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}unlike the strangely reasonable Veor?!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:23.98,0:17:26.47,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,S-Stay back!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:32.66,0:17:34.74,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 30,0:17:35.69,0:17:37.62,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,S-So handsome!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:37.62,0:17:41.37,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}A young barbarian warrior? \NAnd he's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:41.37,0:17:44.23,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm hard-pressed to think of\Nmany men in the west who look this...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:44.86,0:17:48.63,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Y-You! Stop staring!
Dialogue: 30,0:17:49.17,0:17:51.19,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,From the look of you...
Dialogue: 30,0:17:51.19,0:17:53.83,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I'd guess some beasts showed up \Nwhile you were bathing.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:55.64,0:17:58.36,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,My mother was a warrior \Nfrom the west as well.
Dialogue: 30,0:17:58.36,0:18:00.89,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I've heard stories like this.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:01.38,0:18:06.74,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,When I was young, she told me \Nthere was less nature there,
Dialogue: 30,0:18:07.24,0:18:08.90,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,and fewer animals, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:08.90,0:18:12.80,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Given his age, that would have been\Nthe 16th Expedition...
Dialogue: 30,0:18:12.80,0:18:15.71,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}A lady knight from 20 years ago \Nis his mother?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:18.04,0:18:20.74,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn, I'm actually getting cold.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.70,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:27.70,0:18:31.05,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Honestly, a woman shouldn't risk catching a chill.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:32.65,0:18:35.38,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Let's head back to your clothes.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:35.38,0:18:37.93,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You can use my coat for now.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:37.93,0:18:39.43,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a gentleman!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:40.17,0:18:43.95,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is a man who could pass for\Na western knight doing among barbarians?!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:43.95,0:18:48.82,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or is it just Veor, whose first words to me\Nwere about marriage, who's unusual?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:50.90,0:18:52.07,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:54.08,0:18:55.45,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 30,0:18:55.45,0:18:57.95,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Too close! His face is too close!
Dialogue: 30,0:18:56.29,0:18:57.95,Dialogue Overlap,Veor,0,0,0,,You're turning red, too.
Dialogue: 30,0:18:57.95,0:19:02.71,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad! I don't have enough \Nexperience with men to know what to do!
Dialogue: 30,0:19:03.69,0:19:05.55,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:05.55,0:19:07.84,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You might have trouble\Ngetting down the mountain.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:07.84,0:19:09.77,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,So be it.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:09.77,0:19:11.21,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I'll have to touch you, so forgive me.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.40,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:18.68,0:19:20.85,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You're as light as a feather.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:21.99,0:19:23.32,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:23.32,0:19:26.48,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even I'm surprised at how \Nlittle resistance I can muster...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:26.48,0:19:28.48,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:28.48,0:19:31.17,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are. I've been looking for you.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:32.15,0:19:35.61,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt\Nwhat looks like a nice moment,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:35.61,0:19:39.12,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,but how did this even happen,
Dialogue: 30,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.63,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:40.63,0:19:41.62,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:42.39,0:19:43.25,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Ve...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:43.25,0:19:46.00,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,What, you didn't notice?
Dialogue: 30,0:19:46.00,0:19:49.09,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I suppose I didn't have time\Nto tidy up before proposing, but...
Dialogue: 30,0:19:53.07,0:19:56.76,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,All it took was a shave\Nfor you to blush like a maiden.
Dialogue: 30,0:19:57.62,0:19:59.51,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You're quite innocent, aren't you?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:02.52,0:20:05.33,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I am a maiden, you barbarian!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:08.48,0:20:11.05,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,To strike me with that much force \Nfrom such an unstable stance...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:11.05,0:20:13.78,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I knew there was a reason I liked you.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:13.78,0:20:17.39,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You're bright red. \NAre you going to be okay?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:20.19,0:20:22.98,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,If I had a sword,\Nthat would've been grounds for a duel!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:22.98,0:20:27.79,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Besides, this is your fault\Nfor dragging me into that den of monsters!
Dialogue: 30,0:20:28.58,0:20:30.83,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,You didn't need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:30.83,0:20:31.61,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:31.61,0:20:36.42,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Master Veor patrols areas\Nwhere dangerous creatures might appear.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:37.43,0:20:40.79,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,You didn't seem to want company \Nwhile you were... undressed.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:40.79,0:20:43.18,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I intended to stay by your side at first, but...
Dialogue: 30,0:20:43.18,0:20:45.79,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Compared to the yoitobari \Nwe had for breakfast,
Dialogue: 30,0:20:45.79,0:20:48.69,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,the creatures around the river\Nare all peaceful.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:48.69,0:20:51.94,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,W-Was that dragon really that dangerous?
Dialogue: 30,0:20:51.94,0:20:53.83,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say so.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:53.83,0:20:57.07,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,They have a wild temper, \Nbut they're generally cowardly.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:57.07,0:20:59.90,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Only you would say that, Master Veor.
Dialogue: 30,0:20:59.90,0:21:04.74,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Even if they're herbivores,\Na dragon that size is dangerous for most people.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:04.74,0:21:06.95,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I can't argue with that, but...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:08.08,0:21:11.64,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,I did get to see another side \Nof the woman I love today.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:11.64,0:21:14.08,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,A small price to pay, I'd say.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:15.09,0:21:17.82,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,I-I'm forgiving you, just this once!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:17.82,0:21:20.14,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Only because the scenery was nice.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:21.17,0:21:23.22,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,But it won't happen again!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:23.65,0:21:25.47,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,That's fine with me!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:25.47,0:21:29.27,Dialogue,Veor,0,0,0,,It's reassuring to know\Nhow gracious my future wife is.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:29.27,0:21:30.10,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Wi—?!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:30.10,0:21:32.59,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,You don't get to decide \Nthat I'm your wife!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:32.59,0:21:34.47,Dialogue,Cersei,0,0,0,,Really? Still?
Dialogue: 30,0:21:34.47,0:21:36.23,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Don't give me that pitying look!
Dialogue: 30,0:21:36.62,0:21:38.24,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:41.37,0:21:45.37,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a mess... Although...
Dialogue: 30,0:21:46.85,0:21:53.38,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}I suppose he's easier on the eyes\Nwithout that beard.
Dialogue: 30,0:21:53.38,0:21:55.78,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only a little, though!
Dialogue: 30,0:22:02.95,0:22:03.72,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 30,0:22:07.39,0:22:08.67,Dialogue,Serafina,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why?
